    "notes": "The /host/inbox route resolves through hostMessagesScreenForUri to HostMessagesScreen (conversations, opened on a thread, a programme or every conversation), HostSendsScreen (workspace=campaigns) or HostComposeScreen (an eventId without a thread). Messages follows the organizer hostPeopleOrganizerProvider resolves; hostMessagesControllerProvider composes its list, scope, Booked and Prospective counts from the event's bookings, search and partial pages through composeHostInboxPeople. HostComposeCommands sends one announcement under one request id per draft. Sends composes history, the manual handoff queue, sender setup and the follower update quota; HostAudienceController owns campaign mutations and HostOrganizerPostController follower updates."
  },
