  "composition": {
    "currentLayout": "The /host/inbox route resolves to the People tab's Messages: a search field, All, Unread and Tonight chips, the scope menu (events, programmes, General inquiries), Booked and Prospective in an event scope, the Automatic messages and Sends rows, then the conversations. A phone pushes the open conversation full screen; wider windows keep it beside the list. Sends and the announcement compose screen are their own screens on the same route.",
    "targetLayout": "Same as the current layout.",
